719	.arch-grid__sidebar { grid-column: 1; }
720	.arch-grid__main { grid-column: 2; }
721	.arch-grid__full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
722	```
723	
724	### Pipeline (horizontal steps)
725	```css
726	.pipeline {
727	  display: flex;
728	  align-items: stretch;
729	  gap: 0;
